<#e6b41e>THE WORLD</>
Stand On / Off (air too)		^X
  With The World out, his normals and specials use the
  Stand. With it off he fights on his own.
Stand Strike		_D_DF_F^X
Stand Cancel (during an attack)		^X
  Switches the Stand on or off. Ground only, on hit or whiff.
  Half a bar, plus half a bar per earlier cancel that combo.

<#e6b41e>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#e6b41e>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#e6b41e>SPECIALS</>
MUDA MUDA		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
EX MUDA MUDA (1 bar)		_D_DF_F^C
  Invincible start, longer rush.
MUDAAA!		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
The World (teleport)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  Strike invincible. A / B / C = left / middle / right of
  the screen. With the Stand out: Shinei!
Scales of Horror (counter)		_B_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C
Space Ripper Stingy Eyes		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
  Unblockable.

<#e6b41e>SUPERS</>
WRYYY (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  With the Stand out: Checkmate.
Road Roller (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  With the Stand out: Curse of the Stone Mask.
Chi no Shoukan (3 bars)		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F^A_+^B
ZA WARUDO (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Stops time. Any two of A/B/C work for the 1 and 3 bar
  supers with two buttons.
